02)--ProjectionExec: expr=[min(u.x) ORDER BY [u.x ASC NULLS LAST] ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW@1 as m]
03)----BoundedWindowAggExec: wdw=[min(u.x) ORDER BY [u.x ASC NULLS LAST] ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW: Field { "min(u.x) ORDER BY [u.x ASC NULLS LAST] ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW": nullable Int32 }, frame: ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW], mode=[Sorted]
04)------SortExec: expr=[x@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]
05)--------DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]

