03)----BoundedWindowAggExec: wdw=[sum(unsigned_v.x) ORDER BY [unsigned_v.x DESC NULLS FIRST] ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW: Field { "sum(unsigned_v.x) ORDER BY [unsigned_v.x DESC NULLS FIRST] ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW": nullable UInt64 }, frame: ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW], mode=[Sorted]
04)------SortExec: expr=[x@0 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[false]
05)--------DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]

