03)----BoundedWindowAggExec: wdw=[count(n.x) ORDER BY [n.x ASC NULLS LAST] ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW: Field { "count(n.x) ORDER BY [n.x ASC NULLS LAST] ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW": Int64 }, frame: ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW], mode=[Sorted]
04)------SortExec: expr=[x@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]
