02)--ProjectionExec: expr=[max(filtered.x) FILTER (WHERE filtered.x > Int64(2)) ORDER BY [filtered.ts ASC NULLS LAST] RANGE BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW@2 as m]
03)----BoundedWindowAggExec: wdw=[max(filtered.x) FILTER (WHERE filtered.x > Int64(2)) ORDER BY [filtered.ts ASC NULLS LAST] RANGE BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW: Field { "max(filtered.x) FILTER (WHERE filtered.x > Int64(2)) ORDER BY [filtered.ts ASC NULLS LAST] RANGE BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW": nullable Int32 }, frame: RANGE BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW], mode=[Sorted]
04)------SortExec: expr=[ts@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]
05)--------DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]

